{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1023884-slasher-update","id":1023884,"title":"Slasher Update","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-29T12:17:03-08:00","id":1023884,"title":"Slasher Update","content":"I don't know what's happening with Slasher in the CofD, if the writers are planning a 2E treatment or not, but I\u2026 I can't stop. I must do it again. Again. Again. Again. And again. Until they're all gone. Then I have to wait until next year, until the Anniversary. I can't stop. It started with vengeance, but I've gone farther. A part of me is horrified to learn I am trapped in a tale no longer of my telling. The other just wants more red on my hook.<br /> <br /> I can't wait for you, Onyx Path. It must happen sooner. The Anniversary is near. Friday the 13<sup>th</sup>. When that happens, I must redden my hook again.<br /> <br /> To that purpose, I want to update Slasher for my own games. A homebrew solution in the spirit of CofD.<br /> <br /> I like the Undertakings and the Ripper-Scourge types, but I have beefs with the Talents and the Frailties. I feel they need a bit of an update.<br /> <br /> So I'm trying to think of how to do that.<br /> I'll post ideas as they come to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-29T18:17:40-08:00","id":1024039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Serpent Axis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1023884-slasher-update#post1023884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the Undertakings and the Ripper-Scourge types, but I have beefs with the Talents and the Frailties. I feel they need a bit of an update.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could not Frailties work as Weakness mechanics of Horrors from <b>CoD Rulebook</b> ( like Bans or Banes ) and Talents simply as limited Dread Powers? It would SOOO MUCH simpler all things...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T05:14:45-08:00","id":1024236,"title":"","content":"Yeah, using the Horror rules is a good patch job.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, it seems that Hunter 2E is going to reintroduce Slashers as the main plot-instigator, in the same vein of Strix for Vampire, Idigam for Werewolf, and such.<br /> <br /> Oh, and I've seen some homebrewed 2E updates somewhere in the forums. Try searching, and maybe you'll find what you want?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"